  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">MDTF (UgDRP) - V&#xe4;rldsbanken</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MDTF (UgDRP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Programmet best&#xe5;r av en s k Multi-Donor Trust Fund dvs en mekanism f&#xf6;r samfinasiering av bidrag till Ugandas regering och andra mottagare. Programmet m&#xf6;jligg&#xf6;r f&#xf6;r Ugandas regering att genomf&#xf6;ra sin Plan f&#xf6;r fred, &#xe5;terh&#xe4;mtning och utveckling genom att st&#xf6;dja den sociala och ekonomiska &#xe5;teranpassningen av fd stridande rebeller som &#xe5;terv&#xe4;nt.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme consists of a Multi-Donor Trust Fund grant to the Government of Uganda (GoU) and other recipients. The programme assists the GoU in achieving the objectives of the Peace, Recovery and Development Plan for northern Uganda by supporting the social and economic reintegration of former rebel combatants into the communities to which they return.</narrative>
  </description>
